OL,3,GNEWSAUp to 40 homes could be built on
OL,4,A'key' car park
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 'key' city centre car park could be
OL,7,Fturned into 40 new homes as part of
OL,8,Fcouncil housing plans.
OL,10,FSouthgate Moorings in Gloucester, which
OL,11,Fhas space for 179 cars, has been marked
OL,12,Ffor development.
OL,14,FAt a Gloucester City Council meeting
OL,15,Fearlier this week, councillor Andrew
OL,16,FGravells said the car park "is key to
OL,17,Fwhat's going on here in the Gloucester
OL,18,FDocks area and I really do wonder
OL,19,Fwhether or not we are doing the right
OL,20,Fthing by removing the car park".
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
